# Septuvo VPN: members of this group may connect and disconnect
# (septuvo connect / disconnect). Status is readable by everyone.
g septuvo -
# Captive-portal sign-in helper (N3-02): a dedicated system account with no
# login, no home and no other rights. While a captive-portal window is open,
# only programs running as this account may reach web servers outside the
# tunnel; they can never use the tunnel itself.
u septuvo-portal - "Septuvo captive-portal sign-in helper" - -
